<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>ai-content-writing-prompts</title>
<style>
body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #111; }
h1 { font-size: 18pt; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<p>StartbusinessAI Prompt Pack: AI Content Writing<br><br>Use these prompts with ChatGPT, Claude, or another AI writing tool. Replace bracketed text with your niche, buyer, and offer.<br><br>1. Niche Positioning<br>Act as a content strategist. I want to offer AI-assisted content writing for [buyer type] in [niche]. Suggest 5 narrow service packages, the pain each solves, and a simple deliverable for each.<br><br>2. Client Research<br>Research the likely content problems for [buyer type]. List their goals, objections, audience, common offers, and topics they need to explain repeatedly.<br><br>3. Content Pillars<br>Create 5 content pillars for [buyer type] that help them attract [target customer]. For each pillar, give 10 post ideas and 3 blog ideas.<br><br>4. Blog Outline<br>Create an SEO-friendly outline for an article titled &quot;[topic]&quot; for [audience]. Include search intent, H2 sections, examples, and a clear call to action.<br><br>5. First Draft<br>Write a clear, useful first draft for this outline: [paste outline]. Use a helpful expert tone, avoid hype, and include practical examples.<br><br>6. Editing Pass<br>Edit this draft for clarity, structure, accuracy, and conversion. Keep the voice simple and professional: [paste draft].<br><br>7. Social Repurpose<br>Turn this article into 10 LinkedIn posts, 5 short captions, and 3 email newsletter ideas: [paste article].<br><br>8. Sample Pack<br>Create a sample content pack for [niche] that includes 3 posts, 1 blog intro, 1 email, and a short explanation of the strategy.<br><br>9. Monthly Retainer<br>Design a monthly content writing package for [buyer type]. Include deliverables, workflow, pricing tiers, revision rules, and client onboarding questions.<br><br>10. Outreach Message<br>Write 5 short outreach messages offering a content sample to [buyer type]. Make them specific, polite, and low pressure.<br><br>11. Content Calendar<br>Create a 30-day content calendar for [business] selling [offer]. Include post topic, format, hook, and CTA.<br><br>12. Quality Checklist<br>Create a checklist I can use before delivering AI-assisted content to a client.<br></p>
</body>
</html>
